{"content":"{\n  \"status\": \"needs_information\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    \"合成药Y的拟用剂量、给药频次、剂量递增/固定剂量方案和最大暴露时间是什么？\",\n    \"合成药Y的靶点或作用机制是什么？\",\n    \"目标研究人群的具体定义是什么（IPF诊断标准、FVC%predicted和DLCO%predicted入选范围、年龄、是否允许稳定背景抗纤维化治疗、是否允许近期急性加重史等）？\",\n    \"是否计划期中分析？若计划，需明确期中分析的时机/信息分数、目的（无效性/疗效/安全性）、决策规则、负责方、α分配及对最终分析的影响。\",\n    \"是否有合成药Y前期临床或同类药数据可用于设定主要终点的预期效应量和FVC%predicted变化变异？\"\n  ],\n  \"unresolved_questions\": [],\n  \"objectives\": {\n    \"primary\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"在成人IPF受试者中评估口服合成药Y相对于安慰剂的优效性：主要比较第24周自基线FVC%predicted的变化。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"研究为II期、安慰剂对照的IPF试验；文献提示II期常采用第12或24周FVC%predicted变化作为主要疗效评价，DLCO作为支持性指标。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-7ea3302d49ff50ed5f41f585ceaa51044111c78959d5a694d1c4152c5eb08c25\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"while phase II trials frequently use change in FVC % predicted at week 12 or 24 with DLCO as a supportive measure [5].\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"secondary\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评估合成药Y对第12周自基线FVC%predicted变化和第24周自基线FVC绝对值（mL）变化的影响。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"FVC是IPF公认疗效指标；第12周提供早期信号，第24周绝对值变化可与III期常用终点衔接。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-7ea3302d49ff50ed5f41f585ceaa51044111c78959d5a694d1c4152c5eb08c25\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Treatment effect on absolute FVC change at week 52 remains the accepted primary endpoint for phase III trials in this disease\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评估合成药Y对第24周自基线DLCO%predicted变化的影响。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"文献将DLCO列为II期IPF试验的支持性肺功能指标。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-7ea3302d49ff50ed5f41f585ceaa51044111c78959d5a694d1c4152c5eb08c25\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"with DLCO as a supportive measure\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评估安全性和耐受性：TEAEs、SAEs、导致停药或剂量调整的AE、实验室/心电图/生命体征异常。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"II期需同步评估安全性；具体关注点取决于尚缺的靶点和剂量信息。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评估口服药代动力学（如适用）及药效学/生物标志物（待靶点明确后定义）。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"早期临床开发常纳入PK/PD以支持剂量选择；因靶点和机制未提供，生物标志物需后续确定。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      }\n    ],\n    \"questions\": []\n  },\n  \"endpoint\": {\n    \"primary_endpoint\": {\n      \"text\": \"第24周自基线FVC%predicted的变化（连续变量）。\",\n      \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n      \"reason\": \"文献提示II期IPF试验常使用第12或24周FVC%predicted变化；第24周可提供比第12周更持久的疗效信号。\",\n      \"references\": [\n        {\n          \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-7ea3302d49ff50ed5f41f585ceaa51044111c78959d5a694d1c4152c5eb08c25\",\n          \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n          \"quote\": \"while phase II trials frequently use change in FVC % predicted at week 12 or 24 with DLCO as a supportive measure [5].\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"measurement_details\": \"肺功能检测按ATS/ERS标准并使用中心化/经认证设备；基线为随机化前最近一次合格测量；第12周和第24周为关键评估时点；缺失或不可评估测量由中心肺功能质量审核判定。\",\n    \"key_secondary\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"第12周自基线FVC%predicted变化。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"第12周可提供早期疗效信号，并与第24周主分析构成重复测量。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"第24周自基线FVC绝对值（mL）变化。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"FVC绝对值变化是IPF常用疗效指标，可与III期终点衔接。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-7ea3302d49ff50ed5f41f585ceaa51044111c78959d5a694d1c4152c5eb08c25\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Treatment effect on absolute FVC change at week 52 remains the accepted primary endpoint for phase III trials in this disease\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"第24周自基线DLCO%predicted变化。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"DLCO是IPF支持性肺功能指标。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-7ea3302d49ff50ed5f41f585ceaa51044111c78959d5a694d1c4152c5eb08c25\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"with DLCO as a supportive measure\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"第24周复合进展终点：FVC%predicted相对基线绝对下降≥10%或死亡/肺移植的受试者比例。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"复合进展终点可减少死亡/移植截尾偏倚，并提供临床相关的事件性评价。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"安全性和耐受性：TEAEs、SAEs、导致停药或剂量调整的AE、实验室/心电图/生命体征异常。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"II期需同步评估安全性，具体关注点取决于尚缺的靶点和剂量信息。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"健康相关生活质量变化（如SGRQ）。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"IPF中症状和生活质量是重要补充维度。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"PK/PD/生物标志物（待靶点明确后定义）。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"早期临床开发常纳入PK/PD以支持剂量选择；因靶点和机制未提供，生物标志物需后续确定。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      }\n    ],\n    \"questions\": []\n  },\n  \"estimand\": {\n    \"treatment\": {\n      \"text\": \"合成药Y口服（剂量/频次待定）与安慰剂比较；按随机分配的治疗组分析。若允许背景抗纤维化治疗，则两组均需稳定背景治疗。\",\n      \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n      \"reason\": \"已确认口服和安慰剂对照；剂量及背景治疗允许性尚缺，需在最终估计目标中明确。\",\n      \"references\": []\n    },\n    \"population\": {\n      \"text\": \"确诊IPF的成人受试者，符合ATS/ERS/JRS/ALAT IPF诊断标准；建议入组轻至中度肺功能受损（如FVC%predicted 50–90%、DLCO%predicted 30–80%）；是否允许稳定背景抗纤维化治疗、年龄范围和急性加重史需确认。\",\n      \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n      \"reason\": \"文献支持IPF诊断需依据ATS/ERS/JRS/ALAT指南；肺功能范围和背景治疗允许性会影响疗效估计。\",\n      \"references\": [\n        {\n          \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-7ea3302d49ff50ed5f41f585ceaa51044111c78959d5a694d1c4152c5eb08c25\",\n          \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/6:p\",\n          \"quote\": \"Diagnosis of idiopathic pulmonary fibrosis is established by an official ATS/ERS/JRS/ALAT clinical practice guideline, which requires high-resolution computed tomography (HRCT) showing a usual interstitial pneumonia (UIP) pattern, or a surgical lung biopsy, in patients without an identifiable alternative cause [1].\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"variable\": {\n      \"text\": \"第24周自基线FVC%predicted的变化。\",\n      \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n      \"reason\": \"与主要终点一致；FVC%predicted是IPF肺功能疗效评价的核心变量。\",\n      \"references\": [\n        {\n          \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-7ea3302d49ff50ed5f41f585ceaa51044111c78959d5a694d1c4152c5eb08c25\",\n          \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n          \"quote\": \"while phase II trials frequently use change in FVC % predicted at week 12 or 24 with DLCO as a supportive measure [5].\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"ice_strategy\": {\n      \"text\": \"治疗政策（treatment policy）：无论是否停用研究治疗、是否启动禁用/补救性抗纤维化治疗，均按随机分配纳入所有可获得的FVC测量；死亡和肺移植采用预先定义的复合终点或最差秩/最差可能值处理。\",\n      \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n      \"reason\": \"II期意向性疗效估计通常反映随机分配后的治疗政策效应；死亡/肺移植若简单截尾会引入偏倚，应在SAP中预定义复合或最差处理。\",\n      \"references\": []\n    },\n    \"ice_events\": [\n      \"停用研究治疗\",\n      \"启动禁用/补救性抗纤维化治疗\",\n      \"肺移植\",\n      \"死亡\",\n      \"失访或缺失第24周FVC测量\"\n    ],\n    \"summary_measure\": {\n      \"text\": \"合成药Y组与安慰剂组第24周FVC%predicted平均变化之差（95% CI），基于ITT/full analysis set，采用MMRM估计。\",\n      \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n      \"reason\": \"连续终点组间均值差是安慰剂对照II期最直接的疗效汇总指标；MMRM可处理重复测量和随机缺失。\",\n      \"references\": []\n    },\n    \"questions\": []\n  },\n  \"interim_planning\": null,\n  \"non_inferiority_margin\": null,\n  \"sample_size\": {\n    \"assumptions\": [\n      \"主要终点为第24周自基线FVC%predicted变化；随机化1:1；双侧α=0.05；power=80%；样本量用两样本均值比较公式近似（实际分析为MMRM）。\",\n      \"假设安慰剂组第24周FVC%predicted平均下降2.0个百分点，合成药Y组平均下降0.0个百分点，组间差异Δ=2.0个百分点。\",\n      \"假设第24周FVC%predicted变化的个体标准差σ=5.0个百分点。\",\n      \"预计15%受试者因退出、失访或不可评估缺失而无法提供第24周主要终点数据。\"\n    ],\n    \"alpha\": \"双侧0.05（优效性检验）。当前未确认期中分析，故不进行α分配；若后续确认期中分析，需另行规定α消耗函数。\",\n    \"power\": \"80%。若要求90% power，按相同假设每组约132例，共约264例可评估；考虑15%缺失后约312例。\",\n    \"model\": \"主要分析采用MMRM：因变量为第12周和第24周自基线FVC%predicted变化，固定效应包括治疗、访视、治疗×访视、基线FVC%predicted及随机分层因素，非结构化协方差；缺失数据按MAR处理。样本量公式：n/组=2×(z_{0.975}+z_{0.80})^2×σ^2/Δ^2=2×(1.96+0.8416)^2×5.0^2/2.0^2≈98.1，取99例/组（198例可评估）。\",\n    \"planned_n\": \"计划约234例（每组117例），按15%缺失放大后的80% power场景。若采用90% power，计划约312例（每组156例）。最终N需根据真实效应量、变异、失访和期中分析设定更新。\",\n    \"attrition\": \"假设15%退出/失访/不可评估缺失；198例可评估÷0.85≈232.9，取234例计划入组（每组117例）。\",\n    \"justification\": \"II期安慰剂对照IPF研究需在可操作样本量下检测肺功能获益信号；文献提示II期常用第12或24周FVC%predicted变化，DLCO作为支持性指标。当前效应量和变异为保守假设，样本量应在获得剂量/人群/效应量假设后更新。\",\n    \"references\": [\n      {\n        \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-7ea3302d49ff50ed5f41f585ceaa51044111c78959d5a694d1c4152c5eb08c25\",\n        \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n        \"quote\": \"while phase II trials frequently use change in FVC % predicted at week 12 or 24 with DLCO as a supportive measure [5].\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"questions\": [\n      \"是否有合成药Y前期临床或同类药数据可用于设定预期效应量Δ和FVC%predicted变化标准差σ？\"\n    ]\n  }\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"design-elements.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"design-elements-intake","sha256":"53c1137eb7deed1e26b110da5710ac61b77bbcbe9b59a7fc9dfbe2a63bc16fe0"}],"logical_call_id":"call:design-elements:b73ad86daf30070ae2c25adc122f735c8825abc2923feb3cb6492f925c9b0051:design-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:design-elements:b73ad86daf30070ae2c25adc122f735c8825abc2923feb3cb6492f925c9b0051:design-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/design-elements-output.v1.json","output_sha256":"d338923a3be6b6a5f5056a9b45103d9d95dbed199d4ca931304a068dc0976b7e","prompt_sha256":"21bf2955294ee9cc2fd35ad41a9fec8e8279bf3e566b47d7babf7c624d527a38","provider_session_id":"c5ead6a6-7eec-4293-a31d-5cbb22942f92","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}